            "sid": "EZK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji iro nyamandu riko moyo rerekoghe rikighenda, agho magurudumu ghereghendanyeghe naro, na iji rerewukieghe noko ighu, agho magurudumu ghikawukanya naro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andu kose roho yawo erekundieghe righende, iro nyamandu rereghendieghe, na agho magurudumu ghikawukanya naro, kwa kukaia roho ya iro nyamandu riko moyo erekoghe andenyi ya agho magurudumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji iro nyamandu rereghendieghe, na agho magurudumu wokoni ghereghendieghe; iji reremangeghe kimusi na agho magurudumu gheremangeghe, na iji gherewukieghe, ghikawuka chiaimweri naro; kwa kukaia roho ya iro nyamandu riko moyo edeeka andenyi ya agho magurudumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
